    <h1 id="welcome-to-markopress" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#welcome-to-markopress">#</a> Welcome to MarkoPress</h1>
<p>MarkoPress is a modern static site generator that combines the simplicity of Markdown-based content with the power of Marko.js components.</p>
<h2 id="features" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features">#</a> Features</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Markdown + Frontmatter</strong> - Write content in Markdown with YAML frontmatter</li>
<li><strong>File-based Routing</strong> - Auto-generate routes from your content structure</li>
<li><strong>Plugin System</strong> - Extend functionality with a powerful plugin architecture</li>
<li><strong>Theme System</strong> - Customize your site with slot-based theme overrides</li>
<li><strong>VitePress Compatible</strong> - Use existing VitePress content with minimal changes</li>
<li><strong>Docusaurus Compatible</strong> - Migrate from Docusaurus with ease</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="getting-started" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#getting-started">#</a> Getting Started</h2>
<p>Create your first markdown file in <code>content/pages/</code> and start writing!</p>
<pre class="shiki github-light" style="background-color:#fff;color:#24292e" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="color:#24292E">console.</span><span style="color:#6F42C1">log</span><span style="color:#24292E">(</span><span style="color:#032F62">'Hello, MarkoPress!'</span><span style="color:#24292E">);</span></span>
<span class="line"></span></code></pre>
<h2 id="documentation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#documentation">#</a> Documentation</h2>
